  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STRENGTHENING DEMOCRATIC GOVERNANCE IN SENEGAL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to strengthen democratic governance in Senegal, by establishing a monitoring mechanism to assess and improve democratic governance throughout the electoral cycle. It will support the Collectif des Organisations de la Soci&#xe9;t&#xe9; civile pour les Elections (COSCE) to form a governance observatory, building on previous experience in advising on and observing elections, and hold the government and key stakeholders to account. The observatory will produce regular reports and insights to measure and foster greater accountability. Additionally, the programme will address governance issues, promote dialogue on national reconciliation, and facilitate governance reforms through a charter on non-violent democracy.</narrative>
  </description>
